<h1>Reset your password</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>, we received a request to reset your password.</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @reset_url %>">Choose a new password</a>
</p>

<p>Or paste this link into your browser:</p>
<p><%= @reset_url %></p>

<p>This link expires in 2 hours. If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email — your password won't change.</p>
